      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHOW LESS (2) opened his account last time out by one length at Richmond Straight over 324m (17.49). Nicely drawn here. Can make it back to back wins. Can continue winning ways. REARRANGED (1) has some solid form under his belt and proved too strong last time to win by one length at this track in a handy 19.44 beating Scott Lottie. Will go close again if runs up to latest. GAME CHANGER (7) goes very well at the distance with two wins and a placing from five starts. Hit the frame latest (19.29) when third at this track in a Grade 5. Can hit the frame with the right run. BEER TIME (3) showed plenty of dash to record a last start win. Hard to beat again.",
